# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
build/
dist/

# memex runtime state (never commit a user's local knowledge base)
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
.memex/
repos/

# Doraemon acceptance scratch: report build chain, not a deliverable
reports/

# Web (Node prerender, tech-design 2.7). 仓库根的 build/ 与 dist/ 是无锚定的
# 通配，会把 web/build/（预渲染脚本——源码）一起吞掉，所以这里显式取反。
node_modules/
site-data.json
web/dist/
!web/build/
